@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【药瓶是被亚里沙<br>用火焰烧热后<br>炸开了】……|#0104Trial08_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果你说的是事实，<br>我也觉得脸上<br>留个烙印痕迹<br>确实也说得通……|#0104Trial08_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可话说回来，<br>为什么<br>那家伙<br>要去烧药瓶！？|#0104Trial08_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"她把药瓶烧热<br><link=\"Objection_01_04_08_01\">没有任何意义</link>啊！|#0104Trial08_Coco004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Fearful_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:会、会不会是她<br>想喝热水……？|#0104Trial08_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:安眠药也能<br>热一下更好喝是吧！|#0104Trial08_Coco005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:亚里沙她<br>根本没有<br>烤热瓶子的理由吧！|#0104Trial08_Coco006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"还不如说，这是艾玛亲<br>对亚里沙作出<link=\"Objection_01_04_08_02\">反击</link><br>想要她的命的时候<br>产生的<link=\"Objection_01_04_08_03\">意外</link>……<br>或者说是指示<br>玛格是凶手的<br><link=\"Objection_01_04_08_04\">死亡讯息</link>……|#0104Trial08_Coco007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这些说法不比什么巧合<br>更有说服力吗！|#0104Trial08_Coco008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你们<br>是不是<br>串通起来<br>想要骗我，<br>啊！？|#0104Trial08_Coco009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


